This folder contains the script for making a wordcloud with the data gathered from the newpaper Aarhusstiftstidende in 1944
Located at Det Kongelige Bibliotek (The Danish Royal Library). 

Google sheet of harvested and categorized news articles: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1t8vOElrV5LKTrl_OMl49l-8RiCXuHqM9X9oQwqv1KIU/edit?usp=sharing
